 Requirement to Test Case Mapping – Instagram Signup

 1. Requirement ID: R1

Requirement Description:  
The user must be able to create a new account using a valid email or mobile number.

Test Case ID: TC01

Test Case Description:  
Verify that the user can create a new account using a valid email or mobile number.

 2. Requirement ID: R2

Requirement Description: 
The system must allow the user to enter a username and password during signup.

Test Case ID: TC02

Test Case Description:  
Verify that the user can enter a valid username and password during signup.

 3. Requirement ID: R3

Requirement Description:  
The system must show an error message if the email or mobile number is already registered.

Test Case ID: TC03

Test Case Description:  
Verify that an error message is displayed when the user enters an already registered email or mobile number.

 4. Requirement ID: R4

Requirement Description:  
The system must verify the user's email or mobile number using an OTP or verification method.

Test Case ID: TC04

Test Case Description:  
Verify that the user can verify the email or mobile number using the received OTP or verification method.

 5. Requirement ID: R5

Requirement Description:
The system must create the Instagram account successfully after all required details are entered correctly.

Test Case ID: TC05

Test Case Description:  
Verify that the Instagram account is created successfully after entering all required details correctly.
